& [SeedArchetype] is a source-reviewed recipe with no concrete value identity
& [ConcreteSeedProposal] is one materialized byte sequence or typed fixture plus construction proof
& [AdmittedSeed] is a concrete proposal whose identity expectations and use receive later signature

& [MutationOperator] is a versioned deterministic partial function with closed carrier preconditions parameters primary dimension declared dependent changes output and resource forecast
& [MutationProposal] is one operator application to one concrete seed or predecessor proposal
& [MutationChain] is an ordered successor lineage where each edge applies one operator

& [Carrier] is exact_bytes admitted_json typed_fixture or declared_relation
& [CoherenceMode] is isolated_break coherent_successor or metamorphic_control
  + isolated_break holds dependent evidence stale intentionally
  + coherent_successor recomputes named dependents through safe pure construction
  + metamorphic_control changes representation while predicting an invariant only as a review proposal

& [ProposedExpectation] is an unsigned hypothesis over stage applicability and dispositions
& [ExpectationReview] is a separate identity over exact output obligation claims and witnesses
& [CatalogueAdmission] is a later atomic signed transition

& [AdvisorySelection] is deterministic greedy coverage suggestion rather than a minimum proof
& [RefinedDisposition] is controlled_proposal_catalogue_formation
